title: The window made small (1100x700, 800x500, the minimum) keeps title bar, rails, toolbar and status bar whole
folders: git-changes

wait 3000
left files
resize 1100 700
wait 900
mark w1100-files
wait 500
left changes
wait 800
mark w1100-changes
wait 500
resize 800 500
wait 900
mark w800-changes
wait 500
left files
wait 500
mark w800-files
wait 500
right symbols
wait 500
mark w800-symbols
wait 500
left help
wait 500
mark w800-help
wait 500
left none
wait 500
mark w800-none
wait 500
resize 200 150
wait 900
mark minimum-none
wait 500
left files
wait 600
mark minimum-files
wait 500
left settings
wait 700
mark minimum-settings
wait 500
left settings:close
resize 1706 920
wait 900
mark back-to-normal
wait 500
quit
